00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,187
Assalomu alaykum!

2
00:00:02,137 --> 00:00:05,800
Bu darsda «Ishlab chiqarish» ilovasini ko'rsatamiz.

3
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:16,687
U non, somsa, tort kabi mahsulot tayyorlaydiganlar uchun: nimaga qancha sarfladingiz, qancha sotdingiz va oy oxirida foyda yoki zarar — hammasini o'zi hisoblaydi.

4
00:00:16,687 --> 00:00:18,475
Ilova bepul.

